window.bookSummaryJSON = "(Edited September 24, 2017) <h4> <b>. He’s coming for me. The man who leaves little gifts and creepy pictures. The only person I can turn to may never love me the way I need to be loved. </b></h4><b> </b> <b> Ella </b> He’s cold. He’s merciless. He's my brothers second. His cold demeanor shouldn’t be a turn on but it is. Let's face it he's hot. He's also the only thing standing between me and my stalker. Oh and I'm pregnant with his child. . <b> Jace </b> She's beautiful. She's pure and innocent. She's my president's twin sister. I shouldn't want her but I can't seem to stay away. I want nothing more than to corrupt her. And she's Pregnant with my child. Now there's someone out there. He's stalking her. Stalking what's mine. <b> Can she capture his heart? Can He keep her safe? Or will the stalker get his prize? <b></b> Make sure to check out the end. There are some recipes there that are mentioned in the book. This can be read as a standalone novel. *WARNING* This work of fiction is intended for mature audiences only. All sexually active characters portrayed in this ebook are eighteen years of age or older. Please do not buy if strong sexual situations, dark situations, dark real-life situations, violence, drugs, domestic discipline, and explicit language offends you. </b>"; 
